后之兄。","link_td_id":"Q10004379","link_td_number_id":5996958,"people_name":"信","people_name_jianti_auto":"信","people_xingming":"王信","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8f31a968-db0e-11ef-b014-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"王仲，右扶风槐里县（治所位于今陕西省咸阳市兴平县）人，与妻子臧儿，生有一子两女，子名王信，长女王氏，次女王儿姁。长女和次女皆为汉景帝的后妃。长女王氏即王皇后，汉武帝的生母。王仲早逝后，葬于槐里县，其妻臧儿改嫁田氏。后来，外孙汉武帝即位，追尊王仲为共侯，置园邑二百家。","link_td_id":"Q10013012","link_td_number_id":1545069,"people_name":"仲","people_name_jianti_auto":"仲","people_xingming":"王仲","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8f31a969-db0e-11ef-a8a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"田氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"田氏","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"8f31a96b-db0e-11ef-88a4-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-130,"link_td_description":"田蚡，内史长陵（今陕西咸阳市东北）人，西汉政治人物。汉武帝的舅舅、大臣，封武安侯。后来与魏其侯窦婴不和，设计杀害灌夫及窦婴，窦婴死后，田蚡亦发疯而亡。《史记》中说，占卜师分析田蚡是因为窦婴和灌夫两鬼的灵魂缠身而死亡。","link_td_id":"Q10008552","link_td_number_id":325827,"people_name":"蚡","people_name_jianti_auto":"蚡","people_xingming":"田蚡","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8f31a96d-db0e-11ef-830d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"勝","people_name_jianti_auto":"胜","people_xingming":"田胜","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8f31a96e-db0e-11ef-a069-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-202,"link_death_year":-157,"link_td_description":"汉文帝刘恒，中国汉朝（西汉）初期皇帝，于公元前180年至前157年在位，共23年，庙号太宗，正式谥号为“孝文皇帝”，后世省略“孝”字称为“汉文帝”。其系汉高祖刘邦第四子，母亲是汉高祖薄姬（即薄太后），墓葬是汉霸陵（位于今陕西省西安市灞桥区白鹿原）。汉文帝是中国历史上第一位经由推选出来的皇帝，也是一位贤良、节俭、恤民及治国有方的君主，与其子汉景帝共同创造了中国历史上大一统时代的首个盛世“文景之治”。","link_td_id":"Q10000348","link_td_number_id":38105,"people_name":"文帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"文帝","people_xingming":"刘恒","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8f31a96f-db0e-11ef-9e64-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[刘恒]"},{"link_death_year":-136,"link_td_description":"臧儿是西汉初燕王臧荼的孙女，汉武帝外祖母。","link_td_id":"Q10019569","link_td_number_id":5949221,"people_name":"臧兒","people_name_jianti_auto":"臧儿","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8f31a970-db0e-11ef-b8f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-136,"link_td_description":"臧儿是西汉初燕王臧荼的孙女，汉武帝外祖母。","link_td_id":"Q10019569","link_td_number_id":5949221,"people_name":"臧兒","people_name_jianti_auto":"臧儿","people_xingming":"臧儿","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"8f31a971-db0e-11ef-97c7-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-136,"link_td_description":"臧儿是西汉初燕王臧荼的孙女，汉武帝外祖母。","link_td_id":"Q10019569","link_td_number_id":5949221,"people_name":"臧兒","people_name_jianti_auto":"臧儿","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"8f31a972-db0e-11ef-894a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"金王孙，槐里人，汉朝人物，汉武帝母亲王娡的前夫。金王孙和王娡生一女金俗。","link_td_id":"Q10007760","link_td_number_id":1302078,"people_name":"金氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"金氏","people_xingming":"金王孙","start_index":83,"tongjian_id":"8f31a973-db0e-11ef-8469-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"金氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"金氏","start_index":87,"tongjian_id":"8f31a974-db0e-11ef-b0f9-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-156,"link_death_year":-87,"link_td_description":"汉武帝刘彻（公元前156年－前87年），中国汉朝（西汉）皇帝，于公元前141年至前87年在位，共在位54年。汉武帝为汉景帝刘启第十子，母孝景王皇后。其少时先被封为胶东王，七岁被立为太子，十六岁登基，其在位期间首次使用年号纪年。","link_td_id":"Q10000035","link_td_number_id":9444,"people_name":"徹","people_name_jianti_auto":"彻","people_xingming":"刘彻","start_index":104,"tongjian_id":"8f31a975-db0e-11ef-b86e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-156,"link_death_year":-87,"link_td_description":"汉武帝刘彻（公元前156年－前87年），中国汉朝（西汉）皇帝，于公元前141年至前87年在位，共在位54年。汉武帝为汉景帝刘启第十子，母孝景王皇后。其少时先被封为胶东王，七岁被立为太子，十六岁登基，其在位期间首次使用年号纪年。","link_td_id":"Q10000035","link_td_number_id":9444,"people_name":"徹","people_name_jianti_auto":"彻","people_xingming":"刘彻","start_index":106,"tongjian_id":"8f31a976-db0e-11ef-ac6f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-126,"link_td_description":"孝景皇后王娡，右扶风槐里人，汉景帝刘启第二任皇后。生修成君金俗、平阳公主、汉武帝刘彻、南宫公主、隆虑公主。","link_td_id":"Q10002434","link_td_number_id":116887,"people_name":"王夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"王夫人","people_xingming":"王娡","start_index":112,"tongjian_id":"8f31a977-db0e-11ef-ba3c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8f31a953-db0e-11ef-94bd-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"fén","source_anchor_text":"田氏生男蚡勝文帝時","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":41,"text":"蚡","tongjian_id":"3525e5dc-a083-520e-80e7-51ff6e6c4877"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"槐里","place_name_jianti_auto":"槐里","resolved_place_entity_id":1508,"start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8f31a96a-db0e-11ef-a4fd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"长陵","place_note":"陝西咸陽東北","resolved_place_entity_id":1712,"start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8f31a96c-db0e-11ef-9fea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"4初，燕王臧荼有孫女曰臧兒，嫁爲槐里王仲妻，生男信與兩女而仲死；更嫁長陵田氏，生男蚡、勝。文帝時，臧兒長女爲金王孫婦，生女俗。臧兒卜筮之，曰：「兩女皆當貴。」臧兒乃奪金氏婦，金氏怒，不肯予決；內之太子宮，生男徹。徹方在身時，王夫人夢日入其懷。","content_fanyi":"起初，燕王臧荼有个孙女名叫臧儿，嫁给槐里人王仲为妻，生下儿子王信和两个女儿之后，王仲去世；臧儿改嫁长陵田氏，生下儿子田蚡、田胜。汉文帝时，臧儿的大女儿嫁给金王孙为妻，生下女儿金俗。臧儿为子女占卜，卜人说：“两个女儿都应当有尊贵的命。”臧儿于是从金王孙家夺回女儿，金王孙大怒，不肯与妻子分手；臧儿却把大女儿送入太子宫中，生下儿子刘彻。王夫人怀着刘彻的时候，梦见太阳进入自己怀中。","content_jianti_auto":"4初，燕王臧荼有孙女曰臧儿，嫁为槐里王仲妻，生男信与两女而仲死；更嫁长陵田氏，生男蚡、胜。文帝时，臧儿长女为金王孙妇，生女俗。臧儿卜筮之，曰：「两女皆当贵。」臧儿乃夺金氏妇，金氏怒，不肯予决；内之太子宫，生男彻。彻方在身时，王夫人梦日入其怀。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1285,"number":4,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f31a953-db0e-11ef-94bd-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"嫖","people_name_jianti_auto":"嫖","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8f31a97a-db0e-11ef-96f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"文帝","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8f31a97b-db0e-11ef-ac59-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"景帝","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8f31a97c-db0e-11ef-b527-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8f31a97d-db0e-11ef-86a1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"嫖","people_name_jianti_auto":"嫖","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"8f31a97e-db0e-11ef-8086-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"堂邑侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"堂邑侯","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8f31a97f-db0e-11ef-aee3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳午","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈午","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"8f31a980-db0e-11ef-8f6d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":62,"tongjian_id":"8f31a981-db0e-11ef-91b9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"陳皇后","people_name_jianti_auto":"陈皇后","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8f31a982-db0e-11ef-ba16-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"長，知兩翻。嫖，文帝女，景帝之姊。師古曰：年最長，故謂之長公主。余謂帝女稱公主，帝之姊妹稱長公主。嫖降堂邑侯陳午，生女，是爲武帝陳皇后。嫖，匹昭翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"长，知两翻。嫖，文帝女，景帝之姊。师古曰：年最长，故谓之长公主。余谓帝女称公主，帝之姊妹称长公主。嫖降堂邑侯陈午，生女，是为武帝陈皇后。嫖，匹昭翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8f31a979-db0e-11ef-bde7-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"章","people_name_jianti_auto":"章","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8f33f31c-db0e-11ef-8d17-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孔","people_name_jianti_auto":"孔","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8f33f31d-db0e-11ef-9046-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"note_content":"『章：甲十五行本「人」下有「男」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_content_jianti_auto":"『章：甲十五行本「人」下有「男」字；乙十一行本同；孔本同。』","note_type":"『章：[^』]*』","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f33f31b-db0e-11ef-aed2-a0d3651f611f"}],"note_content":"","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":85,"tongjian_id":"8f33f31a-db0e-11ef-87e3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"王夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"王夫人","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f33f320-db0e-11ef-8d14-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"8f33f321-db0e-11ef-89f4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"王夫人之震武帝也，夢日入其懷，所謂符也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"王夫人之震武帝也，梦日入其怀，所谓符也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"8f33f31f-db0e-11ef-b62b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8f340bb5-db0e-11ef-a780-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"栗姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"栗姬","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"8f340bb6-db0e-11ef-b481-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"栗姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"栗姬","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8f340bb7-db0e-11ef-b200-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"嗛，乎監翻，口有所銜也。康曰：恨也。史記曰：帝嘗體不安，屬諸子爲王者於栗姬曰：「善視之！」栗姬怒，不肯應，言不遜。帝恚，心嗛之而未發也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"嗛，乎监翻，口有所衔也。康曰：恨也。史记曰：帝尝体不安，属诸子为王者于栗姬曰：「善视之！」栗姬怒，不肯应，言不逊。帝恚，心嗛之而未发也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":118,"tongjian_id":"8f33f322-db0e-11ef-b8de-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"晉灼","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋灼","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f340bba-db0e-11ef-94e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"臣瓚","people_name_jianti_auto":"臣瓒","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8f340bbb-db0e-11ef-bb96-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"8f340bbc-db0e-11ef-87e0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"8f340bbd-db0e-11ef-8818-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"8f340bbe-db0e-11ef-aef1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"原父","people_name_jianti_auto":"原父","start_index":119,"tongjian_id":"8f340bbf-db0e-11ef-b7c8-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"文","people_name_jianti_auto":"文","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"8f340bc0-db0e-11ef-b499-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景","people_name_jianti_auto":"景","start_index":127,"tongjian_id":"8f340bc1-db0e-11ef-b1a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"班氏","start_index":141,"tongjian_id":"8f340bc2-db0e-11ef-809a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"景帝","start_index":152,"tongjian_id":"8f340bc3-db0e-11ef-9eea-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":172,"tongjian_id":"8f340bc4-db0e-11ef-949e-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"景帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"景帝","start_index":177,"tongjian_id":"8f340bc5-db0e-11ef-b7d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"班氏","people_name_jianti_auto":"班氏","start_index":182,"tongjian_id":"8f340bc6-db0e-11ef-a1f2-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉灼曰：禮有大行人、小行人，主諡官。臣瓚曰：大行是官名，掌九儀之制以賓諸侯者。師古曰：大行令，本名行人，典客屬官也，後改曰大行令。余按班表，帝中六年改典客曰大行令，武帝太初元年改大行令爲大鴻臚，更名行人爲大行令，意其有誤；不然，則追書也。原父曰：史記文、景事最略，漢書則頗有所錄。蓋班氏博採他書成之，故於景帝世謂典客爲鴻臚，行人爲大行。由他書卽武帝時官記景帝世事，班氏失於改革耳，非表誤也。趣，讀曰促。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋灼曰：礼有大行人、小行人，主谥官。臣瓒曰：大行是官名，掌九仪之制以宾诸侯者。师古曰：大行令，本名行人，典客属官也，后改曰大行令。余按班表，帝中六年改典客曰大行令，武帝太初元年改大行令为大鸿胪，更名行人为大行令，意其有误；不然，则追书也。原父曰：史记文、景事最略，汉书则颇有所录。盖班氏博采他书成之，故于景帝世谓典客为鸿胪，行人为大行。由他书即武帝时官记景帝世事，班氏失于改革耳，非表误也。趣，读曰促。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":129,"tongjian_id":"8f340bb9-db0e-11ef-9219-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"而，汝也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"而，汝也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":150,"tongjian_id":"8f340bcb-db0e-11ef-8b12-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"中枢机构","official_name":"大行","official_note":"大行在汉代是负责礼仪和外交的官员，此处指大行令，掌管朝仪和诸侯事务。在上下文中，王夫人派人催促大行请求立栗姬为皇后，导致皇帝愤怒并诛杀大行，显示大行在宫廷政治中可能被利用或卷入权力斗争。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"陰使人趣大行請立栗姬爲皇后","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"5bcc71b3-119b-436e-b8a7-4561ba8ce47a"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"榮","people_name_jianti_auto":"荣","people_xingming":"刘荣","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8f340bcc-db0e-11ef-afb3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-148,"link_td_description":"栗姬，汉景帝姬妾之一，齐国人，美貌出众，她为景帝生下刘荣、刘德、刘阏于三个儿子。","link_td_id":"Q10008273","link_td_number_id":183170,"people_name":"栗姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"栗姬","people_xingming":"栗姬","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8f340bcd-db0e-11ef-b137-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-116,"link_td_description":"馆陶公主刘嫖，汉文帝和窦皇后之女，汉景帝的同胞姐姐。封馆陶公主，又因为下嫁堂邑侯陈午，而称堂邑长公主。她为汉武帝姑姑，尊称为窦太主，她的女儿陈氏是汉武帝的第一任皇后。","link_td_id":"Q10000728","link_td_number_id":36493,"people_name":"嫖","people_name_jianti_auto":"嫖","people_xingming":"刘嫖","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8f340bce-db0e-11ef-be3a-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-148,"link_td_description":"栗姬，汉景帝姬妾之一，齐国人，美貌出众，她为景帝生下刘荣、刘德、刘阏于三个儿子。","link_td_id":"Q10008273","link_td_number_id":183170,"people_name":"栗姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"栗姬","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8f340bd0-db0e-11ef-a29f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-126,"link_td_description":"孝景皇后王娡，右扶风槐里人，汉景帝刘启第二任皇后。生修成君金俗、平阳公主、汉武帝刘彻、南宫公主、隆虑公主。","link_td_id":"Q10002434","link_td_number_id":116887,"people_name":"王夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"王夫人","people_xingming":"王娡","start_index":59,"tongjian_id":"8f340bd1-db0e-11ef-9f43-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[王娡]"},{"link_birth_year":-156,"link_death_year":-87,"link_td_description":"汉武帝刘彻（公元前156年－前87年），中国汉朝（西汉）皇帝，于公元前141年至前87年在位，共在位54年。汉武帝为汉景帝刘启第十子，母孝景王皇后。其少时先被封为胶东王，七岁被立为太子，十六岁登基，其在位期间首次使用年号纪年。","link_td_id":"Q10000035","link_td_number_id":9444,"people_name":"徹","people_name_jianti_auto":"彻","people_xingming":"刘彻","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"8f340bd2-db0e-11ef-9db6-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-126,"link_td_description":"孝景皇后王娡，右扶风槐里人，汉景帝刘启第二任皇后。生修成君金俗、平阳公主、汉武帝刘彻、南宫公主、隆虑公主。","link_td_id":"Q10002434","link_td_number_id":116887,"people_name":"王夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"王夫人","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"8f340bd3-db0e-11ef-87fa-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[王娡]"},{"link_death_year":-148,"link_td_description":"栗姬，汉景帝姬妾之一，齐国人，美貌出众，她为景帝生下刘荣、刘德、刘阏于三个儿子。","link_td_id":"Q10008273","link_td_number_id":183170,"people_name":"栗姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"栗姬","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"8f340bd4-db0e-11ef-9e69-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-126,"link_td_description":"孝景皇后王娡，右扶风槐里人，汉景帝刘启第二任皇后。生修成君金俗、平阳公主、汉武帝刘彻、南宫公主、隆虑公主。","link_td_id":"Q10002434","link_td_number_id":116887,"people_name":"王夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"王夫人","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"8f340bd5-db0e-11ef-bf5c-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[王娡]"},{"link_death_year":-126,"link_td_description":"孝景皇后王娡，右扶风槐里人，汉景帝刘启第二任皇后。生修成君金俗、平阳公主、汉武帝刘彻、南宫公主、隆虑公主。","link_td_id":"Q10002434","link_td_number_id":116887,"people_name":"王夫人","people_name_jianti_auto":"王夫人","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"8f340bd6-db0e-11ef-a50e-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[王娡]"},{"link_death_year":-148,"link_td_description":"栗姬，汉景帝姬妾之一，齐国人，美貌出众，她为景帝生下刘荣、刘德、刘阏于三个儿子。","link_td_id":"Q10008273","link_td_number_id":183170,"people_name":"栗姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"栗姬","start_index":115,"tongjian_id":"8f340bd7-db0e-11ef-802e-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-148,"link_td_description":"栗姬，汉景帝姬妾之一，齐国人，美貌出众，她为景帝生下刘荣、刘德、刘阏于三个儿子。","link_td_id":"Q10008273","link_td_number_id":183170,"people_name":"栗姬","people_name_jianti_auto":"栗姬","start_index":131,"tongjian_id":"8f340bd8-db0e-11ef-add8-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"8f31a978-db0e-11ef-a92f-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"xián","source_anchor_text":"夫人知帝嗛栗姬因怒","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":114,"text":"嗛","tongjian_id":"88bdbc71-51eb-5574-a252-e258cd83ed16"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","resolved_place_entity_id":25,"start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"8f340bcf-db0e-11ef-aa38-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["权争"],"content":"及帝卽位，長男榮爲太子；其母栗姬，齊人也。長公主嫖欲以女嫁太子，栗姬以後宮諸美人皆因長公主見帝，故怒而不許；長公主欲與王夫人男徹，王夫人許之。由是長公主日讒栗姬而譽王夫人之美；帝亦自賢之，又有曩者所夢日符，計未有所定。王夫人知帝嗛栗姬，因怒未解，陰使人趣大行請立栗姬爲皇后。帝怒曰：「是而所宜言邪！」遂按誅大行。","content_fanyi":"等到汉景帝即位，长子刘荣被立为太子；太子刘荣的生母栗姬，是齐国人。汉景帝的姐姐长公主刘嫖想把自己的女儿嫁给太子，栗姬因为后宫的各位美人都是通过长公主才见到景帝的，因此对长公主心怀恼怒，不肯答应；长公主又想把女儿嫁给王夫人所生的儿子刘彻，王夫人答应了。从此长公主每天在景帝面前说栗姬的坏话，称赞王夫人的美德；景帝自己也认为王夫人贤惠，又因为有从前梦日入怀的祥瑞符兆，对是否改立太子和皇后的事犹豫未定。王夫人知道景帝怨恨栗姬，趁着景帝的怒气尚未消除，暗中派人催促大行，让他请求景帝立栗姬为皇后。景帝发怒说：“这是你所应当说的话吗！”于是将大行治罪处死。","content_jianti_auto":"及帝即位，长男荣为太子；其母栗姬，齐人也。长公主嫖欲以女嫁太子，栗姬以后宫诸美人皆因长公主见帝，故怒而不许；长公主欲与王夫人男彻，王夫人许之。由是长公主日谗栗姬而誉王夫人之美；帝亦自贤之，又有曩者所梦日符，计未有所定。王夫人知帝嗛栗姬，因怒未解，阴使人趣大行请立栗姬为皇后。帝怒曰：「是而所宜言邪！」遂按诛大行。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1286,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8f31a978-db0e-11ef-a92f-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"六年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"六年","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"8f31a949-db0e-11ef-bc0f-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（庚寅、前一五一）","year_int":-151},"message":"success","success":true}